# High-Flying Ace: "{3}{W}: Target creature without flying gains flying until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery." On
# Bot2's turn 2 (not Bot1's) Bot1 has the mana for it but cannot activate. On turn 3 the Ace itself, which has flying, is not
# a legal target; Bot2's Action News Crew is, and the cost is exactly four mana: the pool is empty after paying. The Crew
# keeps vigilance and has flying that turn only.

